  "title": "UK Man Charged with Assisting Russian Intelligence Agency",
  "summary": "A British-Azerbaijani man, Joshua Cammidge, 31, has been charged with assisting a Russian intelligence agency, and his arrest follows an ongoing investigation led by London's counter-terrorism policing. The charges relate to his alleged involvement in a sabotage plot.",
